  m_text: "Sohrai art is now known as the state art of Jharkhand. Railway stations
    in the towns like Hazaribagh and Jamshedpur now greet travellers with Khovar
    and Sohrai murals that only adorned village homes until recently. Sohrai paintings
    are age-old tribal traditional paintings based on nature themes \u2013 forest,
    people and animals etc. The paintings are done by tribal women using natural
    ingredients such as different shades of clay and charcoal. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
